    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "These are a good start, but they're a bit too broad for what I need. When we're talking about media buying, \"global\" or \"cosmopolitan\" is too vague. We need to know who these people actually are to pick the right influencers and locations. \n\nFor the \"Established Connoisseur,\" can you be more specific about the ethnic or cultural demographics? If we're looking at heritage and exclusivity, are we primarily targeting white, old-money families in areas like the Hamptons or London, or is there a specific demographic shift we should account for? I need to know if this is a strictly Western-centric demographic or if we should be looking at other high-status ethnic groups.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
