      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To refine the \"Established Connoisseur,\" focus heavily on affluent, long-standing families, which traditionally skews towards established European or Anglo-American heritage demographics in areas like the Hamptons or Mayfair. However, recognize that the modern \"old money\" definition is expanding; look at established Chinese or Middle Eastern families in major global financial hubs for significant wealth and established luxury purchasing power. Media buys should mirror their geographic anchors—private clubs, established country estates, and elite private jet terminals. This positioning requires visuals that communicate timeless pedigree over fleeting trends.",
      "source": "target",
